# Call of Duty / Warzone — dedicated domain set.
# These get the strictest treatment in smartdns.conf: fastest-IP
# selection measured on ping + tcp:443, aggressive prefetch,
# match-length serve-stale pinning and cache warming.
#
# Demonware runs CoD's backend (auth, matchmaking, profiles,
# storage) — its regional endpoints are chosen by DNS, which is
# exactly what this project optimises.
demonware.net
callofduty.com
activision.com
atvi.com
battle.net
blizzard.com
blizzard.net
activisionblizzard.com
sledgehammergames.com
infinityward.com
treyarch.com
raven-software.com
